wm:recommendedOption a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range wm:Option .
wm:releaseKind a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range wm:ReleaseKind .
wm:releasedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
wm:reportedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range wm:Agent .
wm:resolution a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
