wm:statement a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
wm:status a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range wm:IssueStatus .
wm:structural a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain wm:Entry ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
